+          <h3>A little preparation.<br>A lighter errand.</h3>
+          <p>Select the orders you’re taking, then choose <strong>Preview trip</strong>.</p>
+          <ul><li>Saved order details &amp; dates</li><li>Blank packing and receipt checks</li><li>Space for your own notes</li></ul>
